Z||000001||rogergarrison||03-10-2001||11:49 PM||||Could be your electric cooling fans not kicking on. when you drive its getting airflow. when you stop, withouth the fan drawing it gets hot. Just let it run till it starts getting hot and look to see if fan is running (should be on between 1/2 and 3/4 of gauge. also can turn on ac to see if it runs (its always on with ac).||||reg||1
